# anbernic tracker song
version 3
bpm 120
ticks 6
meter 4 4
tracks 8

inst 00 engine WAVE timbre 2 adsr 0 22 0 16 drive 110 name KICK
inst 01 engine NOISE timbre 0 adsr 0 18 0 14 filter 190 30 72 name SNARE
lay 01 engine PULSE timbre 2 transpose -12 gain -6
inst 02 engine NOISE timbre 1 adsr 0 9 0 5 gain -7 name HATC
inst 03 engine NOISE timbre 1 adsr 0 44 0 30 gain -9 name HATO
inst 04 engine NOISE timbre 0 adsr 0 30 0 22 filter 200 40 76 name CLAP
inst 05 engine WAVE timbre 2 adsr 0 30 0 20 drive 60 name TOM

trk 0 vol 104 pan 0
trk 1 vol 90 pan 0
trk 2 vol 70 pan 0
trk 3 vol 80 pan 0
trk 4 vol 90 pan 0

pat t0 00 len 16
00 C-3 i00 fSWP2E fVOL7F

pat t1 00 len 16
08 A-3 i01 fVOL7F

pat t2 00 len 16
00 A-3 i02 fVOL7F
08 A-3 i03

pat t3 00 len 16
00 A-2 i04 fVOL7F

pat t4 00 len 16
08 G-3 i05 fSWP34 fVOL7F

pat t0 01 len 16
00 C-3 i00 fSWP2E fVOL7F
04 C-3 i00
08 C-3 i00
0C C-3 i00

pat t1 01 len 16
04 A-3 i01 fVOL7F
0C A-3 i01

pat t2 01 len 16
00 A-3 i02 fVOL7F
02 A-3 i03
04 A-3 i02
06 A-3 i03
08 A-3 i02
0A A-3 i03
0C A-3 i02
0E A-3 i03

pat t3 01 len 16
0C A-2 i04 fVOL7F

pat t4 01 len 16
0D G-3 i05 fSWP34 fVOL7F
0E E-3 i05

arr 00 steps auto
t0 00
t1 00

arr 01 steps auto
t2 00

arr 02 steps auto
t3 00
t4 00

arr 03 steps auto
t0 01
t1 01
t2 01

arr 04 steps auto
t0 01
t1 01
t2 01
t3 01
t4 01
